While playing the other weekend, I came upon a different idea.

Situation, loads of hill orcs coming after me while I was standing in a doorway.
They are throwing knives and shooting arrows hitting each other more often
than they hit me.

How about a fight breaks out between a few of them a-la ring of conflict.

"You bozo, why don't you watch what you're doing!" ---More---
The hill orc hits the hill orc.  The hill orc dies ---More---
"Hey, that was my brother!  Now you're going to die!"---More---


You'd still have a few coming after you, but there would be a couple 
farther out attacking each other...

Sounds good to me...

Carl


